1
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,030 --> 00:01:15,970
[Episode 4]

3
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:20,560
Director Xu.

4
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,970
What a coincidence.

5
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:26,300
I didn't expect to see you off the set.

6
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:29,310
Isn't it because of your wife

7
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,740
that we're having a week of downtime?

8
00:01:34,710 --> 00:01:35,509
Director Xu.

9
00:01:36,070 --> 00:01:37,920
I'm still quite looking forward
to our collaboration.

10
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:40,250
I'll deal with the withdrawal of funding.

11
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,080
I don't care how you'll solve it,

12
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:43,430
but I can tell you

13
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:47,680
that you are the only male lead for me.

14
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:50,000
Director Xu, hearing you say that,

15
00:01:50,509 --> 00:01:51,590
I'm truly

16
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:54,430
flattered.

17
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:56,950
Then I can only

18
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,240
play my villain role well

19
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,150
to repay my director.

20
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,760
Then I'm quite looking forward to it.

21
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:07,360
Let's just hope
for a pleasant collaboration.

22
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,680
I hope this time,

23
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,960
we can make a film

24
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,760
that we are both satisfied with.

25
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:12,960
Of course.

26
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:19,400
Director Xu, what treatment
are you receiving here this time?

27
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,079
I happen to be seeing a doctor here too,

28
00:02:21,079 --> 00:02:23,380
so I can ask for you
what you should look out for.

29
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:25,910
[The Second Course of Medication
for Xu Jing]

30
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,360
You'd better
worry about your own face first.

31
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,560
The doctors at this hospital are great.

32
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:32,640
It can help you look good on camera.

33
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,870
Actually,

34
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:41,220
after such a large-scale skin graft,

35
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:42,280
your skin condition

36
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,740
is maintained quite well.

37
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,430
You don't need to worry too much.

38
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:47,030
Every time I face the camera,

39
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:48,310
I'm still worried that something might

40
00:02:48,310 --> 00:02:50,240
suddenly go wrong with my own face.

41
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:52,970
Coming here for a check-up
can put my mind at ease.

42
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:58,750
By the way, Dr. Qi,

43
00:02:59,510 --> 00:03:01,800
have you ever treated a patient
named Xu Jing?

44
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:02,600
[Cosmetic Health Record]

45
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,360
The hospital has regulations

46
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,990
that we can't disclose
our patients' private information.

47
00:03:06,990 --> 00:03:08,120
Please understand.

48
00:03:09,590 --> 00:03:11,750
I just saw a friend in the lobby

49
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,370
who looked a bit familiar,

50
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:15,240
but I didn't dare to confirm it,

51
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,400
so I wanted to ask you.

52
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,950
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

53
00:03:18,430 --> 00:03:20,870
I really can't help you with this.

54
00:03:31,370 --> 00:03:32,370
[Jing]

55
00:03:32,390 --> 00:03:34,890
[The filming went well today.]
[30,000 feet]

56
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,490
[Pursuing my own sun] [Spring]

57
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:50,590
[New Ideas for Sun-Protective Outfits
in Spring and Summer] [Spring has arrived.]

58
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,060
What's wrong, Dear?

59
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,180
Haven't you seen enough of her on the set?

60
00:04:32,430 --> 00:04:33,070
Alright.

61
00:04:33,630 --> 00:04:35,430
I'll print out her photos right now

62
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:37,430
and cover the whole house with them.

63
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:41,040
You haven't resolved
the withdrawal of funding yet,

64
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,840
but you have time to make a scene
in front of me here.

65
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,360
Di'er.

66
00:04:48,970 --> 00:04:51,300
You're about to completely embarrass me.

67
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,950
Director Xu

68
00:04:53,450 --> 00:04:55,720
is a director heavily backed
by Du Chunqing.

69
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,070
If I don't try to get to know her,

70
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:58,870
should I get to know you instead?

71
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,360
Have you supported me to this day
for the purpose

72
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,620
of making me have no roles
to play one day?

73
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:08,110
You're trying to get to know her?

74
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,280
I got the stuff

75
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,610
which you couldn't get.

76
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:18,650
You really should get to know her better,

77
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:22,080
or you won't even know how you'll die
when the time comes.

78
00:05:27,410 --> 00:05:27,890
[Cosmetic Health Record]

79
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:30,810
[Cosmetic Treatment Record]
[Name: Xu Jing]

80
00:05:34,810 --> 00:05:38,030
[Cosmetic Treatment Record]
[Name: Xu Jing]

81
00:05:38,550 --> 00:05:41,010
Xu Jing has also
had plastic surgery before?

82
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,360
[Once a week, after lunch]
[Three times a day, with meals]

83
00:06:05,370 --> 00:06:05,750
[Every Wednesday morning]

84
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,500
[One tablet per day, with lunch]
[Twice a day, after dinner]

85
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:07,100
[Before sleep every day]

86
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,970
Hello, Dr. Fang.

87
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,160
What's wrong?

88
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:29,800
Xu Jing,

89
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,410
I want to explain to you

90
00:06:31,410 --> 00:06:34,409
what you should look out for
while taking those drugs.

91
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:37,390
You've already written them
very clearly for me.

92
00:06:37,390 --> 00:06:38,159
Thank you,

93
00:06:38,530 --> 00:06:39,120
Dr. Fang.

94
00:06:40,270 --> 00:06:42,200
You've already done enough for me.

95
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,090
I think

96
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:45,159
after Mr. Du's surgery is over...

97
00:06:45,159 --> 00:06:45,800
Xu Jing.

98
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:47,600
No one can get through life

99
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,000
relying only on himself.

100
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:54,830
I'm downstairs at your place right now.

101
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:02,560
I'm sorry

102
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,700
for coming here suddenly.

103
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:06,120
I'm just a little...

104
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,800
I know.

105
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,200
You're worried about me.

106
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,360
But Dr. Fang,

107
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:16,430
things between Zhao Xiao and me
are very complicated.

108
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,090
You wouldn't understand.

109
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:24,310
Back then, in the operating room,

110
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:25,950
the moment I blocked your knife,

111
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:28,280
even though I didn't know the whole story,

112
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,020
I could still guess most of it.

113
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:36,790
[Three years ago]

114
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,430
The suturing of your wound went smoothly.

115
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:41,070
Pay attention to your diet from now on,

116
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:42,750
and it shouldn't leave any obvious scars.

117
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:43,390
Thank you.

118
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,600
Dr. Fang.

119
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:55,130
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao Xiao.

120
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:57,480
The dosage
might be a bit higher this time.

121
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,050
Please bear with it.

122
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,170
If you can't stand it, just tell me.

123
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,040
I can endure this little bit of pain.

124
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:07,880
Don't put so much pressure on yourself

125
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,610
just because I'm a minor actor.

126
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,850
My face has recovered
so quickly over these years

127
00:08:12,850 --> 00:08:14,770
all because of you, Dr. Qi.

128
00:08:38,669 --> 00:08:39,480
Xu Jing.

129
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:02,210
If you want to kill someone,

130
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,940
don't point the tip of the knife
at yourself.

131
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,030
Xu Jing.

132
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:12,090
A truly perfect crime

133
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:16,540
would never come at the cost
of sacrificing yourself.

134
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:25,440
Even if you refuse to talk about it,

135
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:26,440
as a doctor,

136
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,220
I can still figure out

137
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:29,880
how your face was disfigured.

138
00:09:31,710 --> 00:09:33,140
Back then, when I blocked that knife,

139
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,070
I just...

140
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:39,250
instinctively wanted to protect you.

141
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,080
Thank you for your kindness.

142
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:45,310
But since I've chosen this path,

143
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:48,230
no matter what price
I have to pay in the future,

144
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:49,560
I will still keep going.

145
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:51,240
What's more,

146
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:58,370
I don't want to drag you into this.

147
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,320
Xu Jing.

148
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:04,190
I don't know what you think of me.

149
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,980
I just want to help you.

150
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,840
After you finish what you want to do,

151
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,360
I will leave on my own.

152
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:25,360
Xiao.

153
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,460
If we can secure
this big production today,

154
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:29,320
you'll transition into a new phase
of your career.

155
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,510
What's more,
Mr. Pei has so many resources.

156
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:32,920
You must do your best.

157
00:10:33,190 --> 00:10:33,750
However,

158
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:36,280
I believe
our Xiao can definitely achieve it.

159
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,480
As for the flowers you asked me to order,

160
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,320
I'll have them delivered right away.

161
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:39,670
Okay.

162
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,670
Director Xu.

163
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,060
This is for you.

164
00:11:42,050 --> 00:11:43,060
What's wrong?

165
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,210
Lan!
